📊 Blinkit Sales Analysis Dashboard – Power BI
The Blinkit Sales Analysis Dashboard is an interactive Power BI dashboard designed to analyze and visualize the sales performance of the Blinkit grocery delivery platform (owned by Zomato). It offers a detailed, user-friendly view of key metrics and trends across multiple business dimensions.

🔍 Key Dashboard Features:
Dynamic KPIs:

Total Sales

Average Sales

Total Items Sold

Average Customer Rating

Interactive Filters (Slicers):

Outlet Size (Small, Medium, High)

Outlet Location Type (Tier 1, Tier 2, etc.)

Item Type (e.g., Dairy, Breakfast, Snacks)

Data Visualizations Include:

Sales by Fat Content (Donut Chart)

Sales by Item Type

Sales by Year of Outlet Establishment

Sales by Outlet Size and Tier

Sales by Outlet Type (Supermarket Type1, Grocery Store, etc.)

Fully Responsive Layout:
All visuals update automatically based on selected filters for real-time insights.

📈 Business Use Case:
This dashboard provides decision-makers with a holistic view of Blinkit's product performance, outlet-level trends, and customer behavior. It supports strategic planning, product optimization, and sales performance evaluation across locations and categories.
